# Netlify Redirects Configuration
# Handles SPA-like routing for student portal and deep links

# Student portal: redirect /student and /student/* to student index
# This ensures deep links like /student/assignments don't 404
/student              /site/student/index.html    200
/student/*            /site/student/index.html    200

# Alternative: If you want true SPA fallback for all unmatched routes, uncomment below
# /* /index.html 200

# Note: The 200 status preserves the original URL in the browser
# This allows client-side routing to handle the path
